<section class="band wrap" id="closing">
  <div class="photo-grid single">
    <figure class="ph">
      <img src="/assets/img/stand.webp" width="1720" height="1180" loading="lazy" alt="Stand" />
      <figcaption class="ph-title">
        <span class="label">Societies fair · September 2026</span>
        <span class="ph-h">Where the team starts.</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="closing">
    <div class="join">
      <p class="label">Join the team</p>
      <h2>We need more than engineers.</h2>
      <p>
        A Formula Student entry runs on design reports, budgets, sponsor decks and
        media as much as on carbon and aluminium. If you are a Northumbria student
        and any of this sounds like your thing, pick the team you would join and
        apply.
      </p>
      <div class="roles">
        {% for team in subteam %}
            <span class="role">{{ team.name }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="pitch">
        <p class="label">Sponsor us</p>
        <h2>Put your name on a first season.</h2>
        <p>Backing a new team buys something an established team can't sell you: a visible part in building a car from nothing. Your brand runs at Silverstone in {{ site.competition.when }} in front of industry judges and every other team on the grid, and reaches the {{ site.members }} Northumbria students behind it, from the engineers building the car to the team sharing the season online.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="mailto:{{ site.emails.sponsorship }}">{{ site.emails.sponsorship }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>
